<section class="mrk-inner-page"><div class="mrk-inner-hero"><div class="mrk-container"><span class="mrk-eyebrow">CONTACT MRK</span><h1>Start Your Project</h1><p>Tell us what you need. Use the store for products and service packages, or send a direct inquiry.</p></div></div><div class="mrk-section"><div class="mrk-container mrk-contact-grid"><div class="mrk-contact-card"><span class="mrk-kicker">PROJECT INQUIRY</span><h2>Let's discuss your requirement</h2><p>Include the service you need, a short description, deadline and any reference material. A clear brief helps us prepare the right package.</p>{% if settings.mrk_email != blank %}<a class="mrk-contact-row" href="mailto:{{ settings.mrk_email }}"><strong>Email</strong><span>{{ settings.mrk_email }}</span></a>{% endif %}{% if settings.mrk_show_whatsapp and settings.mrk_whatsapp != blank %}<a class="mrk-contact-row" href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.mrk_whatsapp | remove: '+' | remove: ' ' }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>WhatsApp</strong><span>Chat directly</span></a>{% endif %}<a class="mrk-contact-row" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"><strong>Store</strong><span>Browse products & service packages</span></a></div><div class="mrk-form-card">{% form 'contact' %}<input type="hidden" name="contact[Subject]" value="MRK Digital Store Project Inquiry"><label for="mrk-name">Name</label><input id="mrk-name" type="text" name="contact[name]" placeholder="Your name" required><label for="mrk-email">Email</label><input id="mrk-email" type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="you@example.com" required><label for="mrk-service">Service / Product</label><input id="mrk-service" type="text" name="contact[Service]" placeholder="e.g. Business Website"><label for="mrk-message">Requirement</label><textarea id="mrk-message" name="contact[body]" rows="7" placeholder="Describe your project..." required></textarea><button class="mrk-btn mrk-btn-primary" type="submit">Send Inquiry</button>{% endform %}</div></div></div></section>{% schema %}{"name":"MRK Contact","settings":[]}{% endschema %}